From 177297b709cc2f29093c91be4c3e81c8a8861f37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:24:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] lactic: port to biosteam 2.54 / pandas 3

- utils.get_splits: use positional .iloc (pandas 3 removed integer
  fallback indexing on string-indexed Series)
- FireWaterTank has no ins/outs in newer biosteam; size it through
  fire_water_flow_rate (fire water is unpriced, TEA unchanged)
- drop removed System kwarg facility_recycle (only used with BDM)
- tighten F402 purity-spec solver tolerance (1e-3 -> 1e-6): the noise
  in F402.V caused a period-2 oscillation of the F402 vapor recycle
  to R403 that prevented SHF convergence (and let the sink-less ethyl
  acetate in the D402 ethanol recycle be extrapolated to ~1e6 kg/hr)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDo4jhmi7JA1qzTHaSinXa
